- synth/vllm_plugins/  runtime plugins for vLLM (Apache License 2.0); no vLLM source is copied.

External tools used but not included: Harbor (harbor-framework/harbor), Terminal-Bench, the Pi coding agent,
mini-swe-agent, Stirrup, vLLM, Apptainer. Their licenses apply to them.

Benchmarks: this repository ships no benchmark items. Item ID lists and download scripts fetch each benchmark from
its official source under that benchmark's own terms (see each benchmark's README; HLE, for example, asks that its
questions not be redistributed). Canary strings in filter code are kept on purpose.
